    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "armored and pronged waiting to drop\npacked tight like a hand grenade\nto only explode in a forest fire\nuntouched by man's hands."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "pieces of it litter the carpet ashen floor\nfallen shrapnel upon unmade desolation\nLying in wait for however long it takes\nTo be the first to seed new life."
    },
